In `"sets"`, between the entries `office-detect` and `office-shared` (the list is ordered by set name), add:

    {
      "command": "node benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/record-office-engine.mjs --tree <tree>",
      "fileCount": 1,
      "manifest": "office-engine/MANIFEST.json",
      "manifestSha256": "fbb76da44f3020d4d363d278f84d68dd4bbd51350c95b98fabe10aa205039070",
